, "end": 84.552}, {"text": "the", "start": 84.552, "end": 84.847}, {"text": "answer", "start": 84.847, "end": 85.338}, {"text": "was", "start": 85.338, "end": 85.632}, {"text": "a", "start": 85.632, "end": 85.796}, {"text": "boat.", "start": 85.796, "end": 86.417}, {"text": "In", "start": 86.417, "end": 86.647}, {"text": "the", "start": 86.647, "end": 86.941}, {"text": "early", "start": 86.941, "end": 87.366}, {"text": "1900s,", "start": 87.366, "end": 88.054}, {"text": "Kuwaiti", "start": 88.054, "end": 88.61}, {"text": "boats", "start": 88.61, "end": 89.035}, {"text": "carried", "start": 89.035, "end": 89.592}, {"text": "fresh", "start": 89.592, "end": 90.017}, {"text": "water", "start": 90.017, "end": 90.442}, {"text": "from", "start": 90.442, "end": 90.802}, {"text": "the", "start": 90.802, "end": 91.097}, {"text": "Shatt", "start": 91.097, "end": 91.522}, {"text": "al-Arab", "start": 91.522, "end": 92.013}, {"text": "in", "start": 92.013, "end": 92.242}, {"text": "Iraq.", "start": 92.242, "end": 92.864}]}, {"start": 93.364, "end": 97.396, "text": "Imagine you're the buyer on the dock, with one coin.", "words": [{"text": "Imagine", "start": 93.364, "end": 93.908}, {"text": "you're", "start": 93.908, "end": 94.324}, {"text": "the", "start": 94.324, "end": 94.612}, {"text": "buyer", "start": 94.612, "end": 95.028}, {"text": "on", "start": 95.028, "end": 95.252}, {"text": "the", "start": 95.252, "end": 95.54}, {"text": "dock,", "start": 95.54, "end": 96.148}, {"text": "with", "start": 96.148, "end": 96.5}, {"text": "one", "start": 96.5, "end": 96.788}, {"text": "coin.", "start": 96.788, "end": 97.396}]}, {"start": 97.896, "end": 105.707, "text": "Imagine the jar leaks before it reaches you. You still pay for the full jar. Worst deal in history.", "words": [{"text": "Imagine", "start": 97.896, "end": 98.456}, {"text": "the", "start": 98.456, "end": 98.753}, {"text": "jar", "start": 98.753, "end": 99.05}, {"text": "leaks", "start": 99.05, "end": 99.478}, {"text": "be