 "start": 116.236, "end": 117.064}]}, {"start": 117.564, "end": 128.113, "text": "Trick one: boil the sea, catch the steam, and leave the salt behind. It works. It also needs a lot of fuel.", "words": [{"text": "Trick", "start": 117.564, "end": 118.064}, {"text": "one:", "start": 118.064, "end": 118.719}, {"text": "boil", "start": 118.719, "end": 119.142}, {"text": "the", "start": 119.142, "end": 119.489}, {"text": "sea,", "start": 119.489, "end": 120.144}, {"text": "catch", "start": 120.144, "end": 120.644}, {"text": "the", "start": 120.644, "end": 120.991}, {"text": "steam,", "start": 120.991, "end": 121.799}, {"text": "and", "start": 121.799, "end": 122.146}, {"text": "leave", "start": 122.146, "end": 122.646}, {"text": "the", "start": 122.646, "end": 122.993}, {"text": "salt", "start": 122.993, "end": 123.416}, {"text": "behind.", "start": 123.416, "end": 124.302}, {"text": "It", "start": 124.302, "end": 124.571}, {"text": "works.", "start": 124.571, "end": 125.38}, {"text": "It", "start": 125.38, "end": 125.649}, {"text": "also", "start": 125.649, "end": 126.073}, {"text": "needs", "start": 126.073, "end": 126.573}, {"text": "a", "start": 126.573, "end": 126.766}, {"text": "lot", "start": 126.766, "end": 127.112}, {"text": "of", "start": 127.112, "end": 127.382}, {"text": "fuel.", "start": 127.382, "end": 128.113}]}, {"start": 128.613, "end": 136.133, "text": "Trick two. Squeeze seawater through a membrane that lets water through and blocks salt.", "words": [{"text": "Trick", "start": 128.613, "end": 129.097}, {"text": "two.", "start": 129.097, "end": 129.73}, {"text": "Squeeze", "start": 129.73, "end": 130.363}, {"text": "seawater", "start": 130.363, "end": 131.07}, {"text": "through", "start": 131.07, "end": 131.703}, {"text": "a", "start": 131.703, "end": 131.889}, {"text": "membrane", "start": 131.889, "end": 132.596}, {"text": "that", "start": 132.596, "end": 133.006}, {"text": "lets", "start": 133.006, "end": 133.415}, {"text": "water", "start": 133.415, 