: 232.647}, {"text": "during", "start": 232.647, "end": 233.143}, {"text": "the", "start": 233.143, "end": 233.44}, {"text": "Gulf", "start": 233.44, "end": 233.804}, {"text": "War,", "start": 233.804, "end": 234.366}, {"text": "a", "start": 234.366, "end": 234.532}, {"text": "black", "start": 234.532, "end": 234.961}, {"text": "oil", "start": 234.961, "end": 235.259}, {"text": "slick", "start": 235.259, "end": 235.689}, {"text": "threatened", "start": 235.689, "end": 236.449}, {"text": "to", "start": 236.449, "end": 236.681}, {"text": "clog", "start": 236.681, "end": 237.045}, {"text": "desalination", "start": 237.045, "end": 237.937}, {"text": "intakes.", "start": 237.937, "end": 238.764}]}, {"start": 239.264, "end": 246.452, "text": "Crews rushed booms around the intakes. Estimates vary, but the spill was millions of barrels.", "words": [{"text": "Crews", "start": 239.264, "end": 239.687}, {"text": "rushed", "start": 239.687, "end": 240.175}, {"text": "booms", "start": 240.175, "end": 240.598}, {"text": "around", "start": 240.598, "end": 241.085}, {"text": "the", "start": 241.085, "end": 241.378}, {"text": "intakes.", "start": 241.378, "end": 242.191}, {"text": "Estimates", "start": 242.191, "end": 242.874}, {"text": "vary,", "start": 242.874, "end": 243.492}, {"text": "but", "start": 243.492, "end": 243.785}, {"text": "the", "start": 243.785, "end": 244.078}, {"text": "spill", "start": 244.078, "end": 244.501}, {"text": "was", "start": 244.501, "end": 244.793}, {"text": "millions", "start": 244.793, "end": 245.411}, {"text": "of", "start": 245.411, "end": 245.639}, {"text": "barrels.", "start": 245.639, "end": 246.452}]}, {"start": 246.952, "end": 250.644, "text": "You get handed the end of the rope. It's the wrong end.", "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 246.952, "end": 247.2}, {"text": "get", "start": 247.2, "end": 247.448}, {"text": "handed", "start": 247.448, "end": 247.861}, {"text": "the", "start": 247.861, "end": 248.109}, {"text": "end", "start": 248.109, "end": 248.357}, {"text": "of", "start": 248.357, "end": 248.55}, {"text": "the", "start": 248.55, "end": 248.798}, {"text": "rope.", "start": 248.798, "end": 249.321}, {"text": "It's", "start": 249.321, "end": 249.569}, {"text": "the", "start": 249.569, "end": 249.817}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 249.817, "end": 250.176}, {"text": "end.", "start": 250.176, "end": 250.644}]}, {"start": 251.344, "end": 261.85, "text": "So can you drink the sea? Yes. But the sea fights back: it takes a very big plant and a lot of fuel.", "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 251.344, "end": 251.639}, {"text": "can", "start": 251.639, "end": 252.019}, {"text": "you", "start": 252.019, "end": 252.399}, {"text": "drink", "start": 252.399, "end": 252.947}, {"text": "the", "start": 252.947, "end": 253.327}, {"text": "sea?", "start": 253.327, "end": 254.044}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 254.044, "end": 254.762}, {"text": "But", "start": 254.762, "end": 255.141}, {"text": "the", "start": 255.141, "end": 255.521}, {"text": "sea", "start": 255.521, "end": 255.901}, {"text": "fights", "start": 255.901, "end": 256.534}, {"text": "back:", "start": 256.534, "end": 257.335}, {"text": "it", "start": 257.335, "end": 257.631}, {"text": "takes", "start": 257.631, "end": 258.179}, {"text": "a", "start": 258.179, "end": 258.39}, {"text": "very", "start": 258.39, "end": 258.854}, {"text": "big", "start": 258.854, "end": 259.234}, {"text": "plant", "start": 259.234, "end": 259.783}, {"text": "and", "start": 259.783, "end": 260.162}, {"text": "a", "start": 260.162, "end": 260.373}, {"text": "lot", "start": 260.373, "end": 260.753}, {"text": "of", "start": 260.753, "end": 261.048}, {"text": "fuel.", "start": 261.048, "end": 261.85}]}, {"start": 262.55, "end": 267.268, "text": "Back on your rock, with the same cup and the same dented pot.", "words": [{"text": "Back", "start": 262.55, "end": 262.898}, {"text": "on", "start": 262.898, "end": 263.12}, {"text": "your", "start": 263.12, "end": 263.468}, {"text": "rock,", "start": 263.468, "end": 264.07}, {"text": "with", "start": 264.07, "end": 264.418}, {"text": "the", "start": 264.418, "end": 264.703}, {"text": "same", "start": 264.703, "end": 265.051}, {"text": "cup", "start": 265.051, "end": 265.336}, {"text": "and", "start": 265.336, "end": 265.621}, {"text": "the", "start": 265.621, "end": 265.906}, {"text": "same", "start": 265.906, "end": 266.255}, {"text": "dented", "start": 266.255, "end": 266.73}, {"text": "pot.", "start": 266.73, "end": 267.268}]}, {"start": 267.768, "end": 275.406, "text": "The lid catches the steam, and one drip lands on your forehead. The salt stays in the pot.", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 267.768, "end": 268.083}, {"text": "lid", "start": 268.083, "end": 268.399}, {"text": "catches", "start": 268.399, "end": 268.994}, {"text": "the", "start": 268.994, "end": 269.31}, {"text": "steam,", "start": 269.31, "end": 270.045}, {"text": "and", "start": 270.045, "end": 270.361}, {"text": "one", "start": 270.361, "end": 270.676}, {"text": "drip", "start": 270.676, "end": 271.061}, {"text": "lands", "start": 271.061, "end": 271.517}, {"text": "on", "start": 271.517, "end": 271.762}, {"text": "your", "start": 271.762, "end": 272.148}, {"text": "forehead.", "start": 272.148, "end": 273.094}, {"text": "The", "start": 273.094, "end": 273.409}, {"text": "salt", "start": 273.409, "end": 273.794}, {"text": "stays", "start": 273.794, "end": 274.25}, {"text": "in", "start": 274.25, "end": 274.495}, {"text": "the", "start": 274.495, "end": 274.81}, {"text": "pot.", "start": 274.81, "end": 275.406}]}, {"start": 275.906, "end": 279.659, "text": "Many big plants do the same thing, just with a fuel bill.", "words": [{"text": "Many", "start": 275.906, "end": 276.201}, {"text": "big", "start": 276.201, "end": 276.442}, {"text": "plants", "start": 276.442, "end": 276.844}, {"text": "do", "start": 276.844, "end": 277.032}, {"text": "the", "start": 277.032, "end": 277.273}, {"text": "same", "start": 277.273, "end": 277.568}, {"text": "thing,", "start": 277.568, "end": 278.131}, {"text": "just", "start": 278.131, "end": 278.426}, {"text": "with", "start": 278.426, "end": 278.721}, {"text": "a", "start": 278.721, "end": 278.855}, {"text": "fuel", "start": 278.855, "end": 279.15}, {"text": "bill.", "start": 279.15, "end": 279.659}]}, {"start": 280.259, "end": 284.432, "text": "Best deal you've had all week. Free refills, technically.", "words": [{"text": "Best", "start": 280.259, "end": 280.585}, {"text": "deal", "start": 280.585, "end": 280.91}, {"text": "you've", "start": 280.91, "end": 281.295}, {"text": "had", "start": 281.295, "end": 281.561}, {"text": "all", "start": 281.561, "end": 281.828}, {"text": "week.", "start": 281.828, "end": 282.39}, {"text": "Free", "start": 282.39, "end": 282.715}, {"text": "refills,", "start": 282.715, "end": 283.455}, {"text": "technically.", "start": 283.455, "end": 284.432}]}, {"start": 284.932, "end": 288.639, "text": "Subscribe for the next one. Just don't drink the sea.", "words": [{"text": "Subscribe", "start": 284.932, "end": 285.54}, {"text": "for", "start": 285.54, "end": 285.801}, {"text": "the", "start": 285.801, "end": 286.061}, {"text": "next", "start": 286.061, "end": 286.38}, {"text": "one.", "start": 286.38, "end": 286.872}, {"text": "Just", "start": 286.872, "end": 287.191}, {"text": "don't", "start": 287.191, "end": 287.51}, {"text": "drink", "start": 287.51, "end": 287.886}, {"text": "the", "start": 287.886, "end": 288.147}, {"text": "sea.", "start": 288.147, "end": 288.639}]}]}